      "Median precision lift over prevalence at K=100 is at least 2.0.",
      "Median top-100 Jaccard across stochastic seeds is at least 0.50 when the method is stochastic.",
      "A graph method also beats its applicable random, untrained, or relation-permuted control under the same adjusted-alpha family."
    ],
    "explore": "Technically valid and above random in direction, but missing at least one utility, stability, or control requirement.",
    "abstain": "Technically invalid, contains no evaluable positives, or does not exceed the random reference in the favorable direction.",
    "confirmation_selection": "For each dataset, confirm only a Recommend configuration. Choose maximum median selection AP, then maximum Recall@100, then minimum runtime, then lexical method key. If no configuration is Recommend, do not read that dataset's confirmation labels.",
